SpecGate reads and writes files in the format defined by OpenSpec
(https://github.com/Fission-AI/OpenSpec, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2024
OpenSpec Contributors) and writes plans in the format used by Superpowers
(https://github.com/obra/superpowers, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 Jesse
Vincent). SpecGate contains no source code from either project; it is an
independent implementation that interoperates with them.

Runtime dependencies:
- @modelcontextprotocol/sdk (MIT)
- zod (MIT)
- @xmldom/xmldom (MIT)
